## Confidence

- That the bug lives at the **boundary between scrub-seek and playlist
  advance**: **high** — the symptom (multi-file cascade during a single drag)
  is essentially diagnostic of an unclamped scrub feeding an EOF/advance path.
- That the fix is **a clamp at the seek-issuing site, plus a guard at the
  advance site**: **high** — this is the standard remediation for this class
  of bug.
- That any *specific* function name or file path I might guess is correct:
